    <p>OA adoption varies by research type: <strong>Case Reports</strong> and <strong>Systematic Reviews</strong> show different OA profiles compared to general Journal Articles. Policy interventions (such as Plan S and the 2022 Nelson Memo in the US) likely contribute to the observed upward trend.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════ SECTION 5: RESEARCH TYPES & COLLABORATION ═══════════════ -->
<div class="section" id="research-type-collaboration">
